diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..0d6724a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,19 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a browser push subscription for the current user. Send the endpoint and base64url-encoded keys from the browser’s `PushSubscription`. Posting the same endpoint again updates its keys; other devices are unaffected.
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push-service.example/subscriptions/...",
+    "p256dh_key": "...",
+    "auth_key": "..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success. To stop delivery for just this subscription, `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:endpoint_digest`, where `endpoint_digest` is the lowercase hex SHA-256 of the endpoint.
