 docker run --env BASE_URL=https://fizzy.example.com ...
 ```
 
+#### Web push notifications (optional)
+
+Set `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` on both the web app and the job workers. Use a stable base64url-encoded VAPID key pair; keep the private key secret. You can generate a pair once with `bin/rails runner 'puts WebPush.generate_key.to_h'`.
+
+People can then enable push notifications on each browser or installed web app from **Notification Settings**. Browsers require HTTPS (or localhost). Without the keys, tray and email notifications still work.
+
 #### S3 storage (optional)
 
 If you'd prefer that uploaded files were stored in an S3 bucket rather than in your mounted volume, you can set that up.
